    "Juno the giraffe": "Shape Savanna. Measures fences, shadows and angles.",
    "Bolt the beaver": "Number Ice Fields. Builds with big numbers and bundles logs in tens.",
    "Kiki the parrot": "Pattern Jungle. Talks in patterns and riddles.",
    "Professor Owl": "Data Observatory. Counts the animals at night and draws the charts."
